{
  "$schema": "../boss-mechanics.schema.json",
  "id": "horn_den_duanka",
  "display": "Necromancer Duanka",
  "display_ru": "Некромант Дуанка",
  "dungeon": "HornCave",
  "source": "authored from the client data (Skill.dat / Abnormal.dat / Npc.dat: skill ids, cast times, cooldowns, damage rows, abnormal ids) + research notes; values marked CANDIDATE/guess are not in the client",
  "note": "Mid-boss (client NPC Lycan_04_V01). Rotation from the client: claw arc 1606970. Lycan Necromancy (client 1607010, cooldown group shared with Soul Calling 1607050 so they alternate every 55 s): 4 linked spirits (2 on Easy, client 1607011), Duanka is invulnerable until they die within the gauge (15 s from research) or the party wipes; the spirits are existing Horn Den lycan templates (guess) and the white-orb altar buff is not modelled. Locked share zone (client 1607030, 6 s Hold; the damage and radius are a guess) and Soul Calling (client 1607050: pull to the centre, twelve orbs 9000-11000 + 1 s stun = client 1607056, then a centre blast: 2400 radius, 3 s stun = client 1607051, 30000 damage = guess). Personal circles (spread, CANDIDATE 600/15000). Easy remaps 1607010/1607030 to 1607011/1607031.",
  "npcs": {"Easy": [2310909], "Normal": [2300909], "Hard": [2320909]},
  "vars": {"necro_ms": 15000, "soul_ms": 6000},
  "rotation": [
    {
      "type": "cast",
      "skill": 1606970,
      "every_ms": 12000,
      "wind_up_ms": 700,
      "radius": 1200,
      "warning": "Duanka claws in an arc: step aside!",
      "warning_ru": "Дуанка бьёт когтями дугой: отойдите!"
    }
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "fury_50",
      "when": {"type": "hp_below", "pct": 50},
      "do": [
        {"type": "modify", "damage_mul": 1.2}
